    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Headers\r\n\r\nIn this level, we'll use AI Tutor to help us understand headers and generate new content for our webpage.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Ask AI Tutor to explain how headers work in HTML\r\n    - You can send AI Tutor a message directly, or highlight the code and select \"Add to AI Tutor\"\r\n2) Ask AI Tutor to add new content that uses headers to this page . Use specific language, like \"header\" or `<h1>`, to make sure AI follows your vision.\r\n\r\nOnce you've added your own content: press the Continue button!",
